{"id":2747,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>3月17日上午，我院在科艺苑学术报告厅举办华彩讲坛。本次讲坛特邀运城学院党委常委、宣传部部长、马克思主义学院院长褚海萍教授担任主讲，我院部分师生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LU4rMkU4A2M4lsMo7LbM4vsMmnVMzVufoRG4L4-YM7-8nzN0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybLYhVMYyiM8CioRGPL4CiMN78MRUbUmUPnlW2LmLbMmVFoRrfnzLsL7MFLmU8M77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8MmlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6465&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D93E757F58013656A4449B41EBF23961/85AE370C/2444A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 546px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LU4rMkU4A2M4lsMo7LbM4vsMmnVMzVufoRG4L4-YM7-8nzN0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybLYhVMYyiM8CioRGPL4CiMN78MRUbUmUPnlW2LmLbMmVFoRrfnzLsL7MFLmU8M77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8MmlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6465&e=.jpg\"></p><p>褚教授从文献准备切入，引导师生们甄别高质量资料与做好日常积累，并鼓励从学术热点中寻找创新方向；同时，她强调提纲作为逻辑主线的重要性，建议大家结合“规定任务完成任务”的理念合理规划节奏，稳步推进论文工作。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LL8VMRUNUZU4UsUoNnRMzUYMmvPU8ru7nzvaUz9bMlVfMl-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPLYysMYyPL7LsoRlYozGZMR94oRv4nRlPL8rkM7rVUmAFMRGDL47iL4VFLmGbL8LJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8MmlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6465&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C137710C7852908483873D513EB4EEB8/40631531/2093C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 550px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LL8VMRUNUZU4UsUoNnRMzUYMmvPU8ru7nzvaUz9bMlVfMl-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPLYysMYyPL7LsoRlYozGZMR94oRv4nRlPL8rkM7rVUmAFMRGDL47iL4VFLmGbL8LJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8MmlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6465&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次讲坛通过系统梳理论文写作流程与要点，帮助同学们夯实写作基础，增强研究能力，引导大家在学术道路上脚踏实地、稳步前行。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LU4rMkU4A2M4lsMo7LbM4vsMmnVMzVufoRG4L4-YM7-8nzN0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybLYhVMYyiM8CioRGPL4CiMN78MRUbUmUPnlW2LmLbMmVFoRrfnzLsL7MFLmU8M77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8MmlJqdUnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6465&e=.jpg"}